OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Airport announces #2bn
OL,4,Aexpansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Airport has announced a #2bn
OL,7,Fexpansion plan which bosses say could
OL,8,Fmore than double passenger numbers and
OL,9,Fcreate thousands of jobs.
OL,11,FThe draft plan, a spokesperson said,
OL,12,Fsets out the use of existing runway
OL,13,Fcapacity alongside "significantly
OL,14,Fenhanced" passenger facilities over the
OL,15,Fnext 15 years.
OL,17,FUnveiling an eight-week public
OL,18,Fconsultation, chief executive Nick
OL,19,FBarton said the scheme aims to ensure
OL,20,Fthe airport was "ready for the future"
OL,21,Fbut needed a "fair and stable taxation
OL,22,Fenvironment".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
