OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Airport announces #2bn
OL,4,Aexpansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,7,Fsaid the government was "backing our
OL,8,Faviation sector to continue growing,
OL,9,Fright across the country".
